    "retain_bounded_record_of_current_signage_packet_or_removal_policy": true
  },
  "capture_and_review_note": "The public archive should preserve a compact policy/payload and, when needed, bounded photo or capture notes for disputed route-changing signs rather than exhaustive sign-image archives.",
